{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.NucleonWordTraceClosedForm","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.NucleonWordTraceClosedForm","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.MarkovTraceOnHecke"],"declarations":27,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.NucleonWordTraceClosedForm.neutronPoly_conventionD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.NucleonWordTraceClosedForm.neutronPoly_conventionD","kind":"theorem","line":356,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/NucleonWordTraceClosedForm.lean#L356-L366","doc":"At convention D: `P_n = (q⁴+1)(q¹⁴ − 3q¹² + 4q¹⁰ − 4q⁸ + 5q⁶ − 4q⁴ + 3q² − 1) / (4q⁹)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.NucleonWordTraceClosedForm.protonPoly_conventionD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.NucleonWordTraceClosedForm.protonPoly_conventionD","kind":"theorem","line":343,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/NucleonWordTraceClosedForm.lean#L343-L354","doc":"At `h = q − q⁻¹`, `z = q³/(q²+1)`, `a = −h/2`:\n`P_p = (q⁴+1)(q¹⁸ − 3q¹⁶ + 7q¹⁴ − 8q¹² + 10q¹⁰ − 9q⁸ + 10q⁶ − 6q⁴ + 3q² − 1) / (4q⁹(q²+1)²)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.NucleonWordTraceClosedForm.tr_neutronWord","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.NucleonWordTraceClosedForm.tr_neutronWord","kind":"theorem","line":329,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/NucleonWordTraceClosedForm.lean#L329-L331","doc":"**`P_n` exactly.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.NucleonWordTraceClosedForm.tr_protonWord","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.NucleonWordTraceClosedForm.tr_protonWord","kind":"theorem","line":324,"s